From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:10:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] soc: google: aoc: import Google's AoC ALSA driver

Import the AoC sound card and its DAI, PCM, control and path drivers
from Google's GPL gs201 kernel (google-modules/aoc/alsa, the android14
gs-6.1 tree that matches the stock AoC firmware). Unchanged and not
built yet; the next commit ports them.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
